@startuml Lihat_Produk
!theme plain
title SD: Lihat Produk
actor Customer
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Buka Beranda
App -> API: GET /products
API -> DB: SELECT products\nJOIN suppliers
DB --> API: List produk
API --> App: JSON produk\n(merk, harga, stok, gambar, supplier)
App --> Customer: Tampil daftar produk

Customer -> App: Pilih filter layanan\n(Isi Ulang / Beli Baru / Sewa)
App --> Customer: Tampil produk + harga layanan\n+ stok tersedia

@enduml
